---

# 1. PROJECT IDENTITY

Project Name:

Depot Container Management System

Purpose:

Production-grade Container Depot Management System for managing the complete lifecycle of containers inside a Depot.

The system must be designed as a real-world enterprise application.

This is NOT:

- A demo project
- A prototype
- A simple CRUD application
- A fake/mock production system
- A collection of disconnected modules

The system must be maintainable, testable, secure, scalable, and ready for real deployment.

