# 36. YARD MANAGEMENT

Yard structure:

Yard
    ↓
Block
    ↓
Bay
    ↓
Row
    ↓
Tier

Example:

A-03-02-01

means:

Block A
Bay 03
Row 02
Tier 01

The system must know:

- Which container is in which location
- Which locations are occupied
- Which locations are empty
- Container status
- Container zone
- Current location

---

# 37. YARD OCCUPANCY

A location cannot contain two containers unless the business explicitly supports stacking according to the configured tier model.

Before placing a container:

Check:

- Location exists
- Location is active
- Location is available
- Location is compatible
- Location is not occupied
- Container type restrictions if applicable

If location is occupied:

Reject completion.

---

